# Claude collaboration workspace — session docs/scripts, not tracked project code.
claude/

# secrets/ holds only SOPS-encrypted ciphertext (*.sops.yaml) — safe to commit,
# hence the !secrets/** override below. Anything actually unencrypted (raw
# keys, local-only config) must live OUTSIDE this directory entirely — see
# /etc/purrbrews/age for the age private key — not just be gitignored here,
# since an override further down or a forced `add -f` would defeat that.
*.env.local
*.key
*.txt
!secrets/**
